{"id":"nachalo","lemma":"начало","pos":"noun","rank":791,"glosses":["beginning, commencement, onset, start","source, origin","principles, basis, basics"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/88/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"начала","plural":"начала"},"examples":[{"text":"Это лишь начало.","en":"This is only the beginning.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"only, merely, just"},null]},{"text":"Я знаю, что это начало конца.","en":"I know this is the beginning of the end.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,null,null,{"g":"end","l":"конец"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"why"]]},{"text":"Это было хорошее начало.","en":"It was a good start.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"good, nice, fine","l":"хороший"},null]},{"text":"Когда начало?","en":"When does it start?","words":[{"g":"when"},null]},{"text":"Начало - самая важная часть любой работы.","en":"The beginning is the most important part of any work.","words":[null,{"g":"the very","l":"самый"},{"g":"important","l":"важный"},{"g":"part"},{"g":"any"},{"g":"work","l":"работа"}]}]}